    "rationale": "Targets sub-area 5: error-corrected/3xTF32 panel reflector formation and re-orthogonalization / iterative-refinement (CholeskyQR2, shifted CholeskyQR3) schemes that preserve FP32 flat-(H,tau) accuracy on the adversarial ill-conditioned/rank-deficient/clustered-SV inputs that break naive CholeskyQR. Numerical-robustness angle that constrains every speed technique above."
